{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00344","headline":"过白卫岭和韩昭 · 後主衍","name":"过白卫岭和韩昭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先朝神武力开边，画断封疆四五千。\n前望陇山屯劒戟，後凭巫峡锁烽烟。\n轩皇尚自亲平寇，嬴政徒劳爱学仙。\n想到隗宫寻胜处，正应莺语暮春天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主衍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}